      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i just got my blood work back from the clinic and my inr is like 5.2?? im on warfarin and im kinda freaked out. the doctor said i need to get it down but i cant get an appointment until tuesday and i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to. is there something i can take or eat right now to bring it down quickly so i don't bleed out? like a specific vitamin or something?",
